# p-lit (plan section 6, M6): P's partners lit. The pointer onto P's row, its head (the role's
# slot, empty past "pinned"), at (200, 690): P's row is (49, 675.5, 394 x 56) at 1440 x 900 in the
# reference's DOM (#fv-point-p). One frame later P's marker has its Ø48 halo in --primary at 26 %
# and drops its dashed lines (1.5 px, 5 4) to both axes; its label holds its place up-right of it.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
move 200 690
# P's partners light at once; the shot waits half a second all the same, as the other states at rest.
wait 500
shot p-lit
